            "review_title": "Review at Dong Kinh Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Eveline E\n4 contributions\n0\nTerrible service towards tourist!\nJan 2020 • Family\nWe were brought by our tour guide to this place for dinner. We arrived and seated down and their staff gave us a baby chair for our 15 months old boy. Dishes were served and before we could even take a bite our tour guide apologised and said that the restaurant only has ONE pathetic baby chair. Told us if we can give the other customer that just came AFTER us our baby chair. What the hell??? We told our tour guide to give us 10 minutes to eat then we will give them the baby chair. Our tour guide tried to negotiate but came back and apologise again. So our poor son ended up sitting on the normal chair! On the way out we saw the child sitting on the baby chair, obviously older than our child. And turns out the group of customers are Vietnamese. I dont know if you give priority to your own people but this is NOT the way to do business!\n\nStay away! Food is tasteless as well! Been to better restaurants!\nRead more\nWritten January 29, 2020\nLong N\nDear Ms. Evelinee,\n\nFirst of all, I would like to appologize for the uncomfort your has encoutered while dining at our restaurant. \n\nFor the baby chair problem, it is definitely our fault not to arrange the only baby chair for the Malaysian (not Vietnamese) group which is booked 1 week before yours (with baby chair request also). \n\nFor the priority in hosting or serving, we are more than happy to put the guests with proper manner first in our list (not gender, not nationality, not wealthy). Consequently, if I were on duty on 27th Januany 2020 and learnt about your misbehaving toward our service staff (maybe beacause your agent CANNOT arrange your dinner at the BUFFET restaurant you expected), I would politely to ask the tour guide to bring your group somewhere else for dinner. \n\nOnce again, thank you very much for your conductive comment (we have purchased two more baby chairs today). We are looking forward to welcome you back at Dong Kinh restaurant in the near future!\nRead more\nWritten January 30, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
