            "review_text": "Yvette B\nAndover, Massachusetts771 contributions\n0\nnew and yummy\nNov 2019\ni was traveling with a large group and a few people found this restaraunt on one of our \"on your own\" meals. Word spread quickly... Several of us subsequently tried it some of us multiple times. it is a little hard to find at first because the door is a slider so if you are not looking carefully it looks like a window. Iloved the duck and garlic eventhough it was a little chewey. i also love the chicken and charcoal. We recommended to our group leader that the company should inquire about adding this place to one of their own.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 1, 2019",
